=====Usage notes=====
The gender was originally feminine (in a translation of Jack London stories, 1915), then masculine (e.g. "Без женщин" by [[w:Alexander Vertinsky|Alexander Vertinsky]]), and today it has become neuter. The masculine variant is typically considered archaic, and the feminine one is completely forgotten.

